; An amount-less posting spanning two currency groups becomes one posting per
; group, each marked __automatic__, and so is a posting whose price number
; is interpolated.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-01 open Equity:X

2020-01-02 *
  Assets:A  10 USD
  Assets:B  10 EUR
  Equity:X

2020-01-03 *
  Assets:A  10 EUR @ USD
  Assets:B  -11 USD
